# Project Rules

This is a production-grade Next.js portfolio website.

Tech stack:

- Next.js App Router
- TypeScript
- TailwindCSS
- Framer Motion
- shadcn/ui

Architecture:

- Components must be reusable.
- UI components belong in components/common.
- Sections belong in components/sections.
- Project-specific UI belongs in components/projects.
- Data belongs in data/.
- Types belong in types/.
- Never duplicate code.
- Prefer composition over copy-paste.
- Use TypeScript everywhere.
- Use responsive Tailwind classes.
- Keep accessibility in mind.
- Do not introduce unnecessary dependencies.
- Keep components under ~200 lines where practical.